：蓄势阶段宜厚植根基。建业久无专精，先定商业以增金入，为后续扩军备战。接受蜀联合攻魏之议，践行联弱抗强之策。柴桑已具军事专精，无虞前线。；密谋揭晓：准备守约"},{"id":44309,"turn":2,"type":"alliance_proposed","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 向 吴 提议结盟"},{"id":44310,"turn":2,"type":"diplomacy_response","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀接受了 吴 的结盟提议"},{"id":44311,"turn":2,"type":"diplomacy_response","factionId":"wu","message":"吴接受了 蜀 的联合进攻提议"},{"id":44312,"turn":2,"type":"develop_city","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 将汉中建设为军镇专精 1 级"},{"id":44313,"turn":2,"type":"develop_city","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 将建业建设为商贸专精 1 级"},{"id":44314,"turn":2,"type":"transfer","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 从洛阳向宛城调动 7 兵力","payload":{"sourceCityId":"luoyang","targetCityId":"wancheng","troops":7}},{"id":44315,"turn":3,"type":"diplomacy_changed","factionId":null,"message":"蜀 与 吴 的关系变为同盟"},{"id":44316,"turn":3,"type":"turn_prepared","factionId":null,"message":"第 3 回合（蓄势阶段）收入与维持已结算"}],"createdAt":"2026-08-19T21:49:49.361Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-19T21:51:12.456Z","exportedAt":"2026-08-19T21:52:06.936Z"}